{"seq":58,"slug":"database-replication-ha","title":"数据库复制与高可用","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据库复制与高可用\">数据库复制与高可用</h1><p>一台数据库服务器迟早会坏：磁盘会烧、机房会断电、网线会被挖断、内核会 panic。当业务把全部数据托付给单台机器时，这台机器的可用性就是业务的可用性上限。复制（replication）——把同一份数据维护在多台机器上——是突破这条上限的根本手段，也是几乎所有现代数据库高可用方案的地基。</p>\n<p>但复制从来不是「多复制几份就完事」那么简单。一旦数据出现多个副本，立刻冒出一连串棘手的权衡：写入要不要等副本确认（牺牲延迟换持久性）？读到的副本数据可能是旧的（牺牲一致性换吞吐）？主库挂了谁来接管、靠什么决定（避免脑裂）？两个地方同时改了同一行怎么办（冲突解决）？这些问题没有银弹，只有取舍，而理解取舍正是这个 hub 想交付的能力。</p>\n<p>四章沿一条清晰的脉络层层递进。第一章「基础」打地基：先讲清复制到底为了解决什么、有哪些拓扑形态，再深入同步与异步两种确认模式的延迟—持久性权衡，最后把各种一致性模型（线性一致、因果一致、最终一致）摆成一张谱系，让后面所有讨论都有共同语言。</p>\n<p>第二章「拓扑」是全 hub 的结构主干：主从、多主、无主三种复制拓扑，对应着「一个写入点」「多个写入点」「没有固定写入点」三种世界观，各自的适用场景、故障模型与代价截然不同。第三章「高可用」把这些拓扑跑起来面对真实故障：主库宕机后如何选主切换、读流量如何分担到副本、并发写入产生的冲突如何收敛。第四章「运维」着眼长期：复制保护不了逻辑错误和误删，所以要有备份与时间点恢复；复制延迟必须被持续监控才能在它伤人前发现；而真正的灾难（整个地域不可用）要靠跨地域容灾来兜底。</p>\n<p>读完这四章，你应该能在面对一个具体系统时回答：它选了哪种拓扑、给了哪种一致性、能容忍多少数据丢失（RPO）、多久能恢复（RTO），以及这些数字背后付出了什么代价。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"replication-overview","title":"复制的目的与拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/foundations/replication-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sync-async-replication","title":"同步、异步与半同步复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/foundations/sync-async-replication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"replication-consistency","title":"复制一致性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/foundations/replication-consistency"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"topologies","title":"拓扑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/topologies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"leader-follower","title":"主从复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/topologies/leader-follower"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-leader","title":"多主复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/topologies/multi-leader"},{"seq":3,"slug":"leaderless-quorum","title":"无主复制与法定人数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/topologies/leaderless-quorum"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"availability","title":"高可用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/availability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"failover-election","title":"故障切换与选主","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/availability/failover-election"},{"seq":2,"slug":"read-write-splitting","title":"读写分离与负载分担","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/availability/read-write-splitting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conflict-resolution","title":"写冲突解决","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/availability/conflict-resolution"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backup-pitr","title":"备份与时间点恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/operations/backup-pitr"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-lag","title":"复制延迟监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/operations/monitoring-lag"},{"seq":3,"slug":"geo-distribution","title":"跨地域容灾","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/operations/geo-distribution"}]}]}